{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03016","headline":"在郡秋怀二首 二 · 张九龄","name":"在郡秋怀二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庭芜生白露，岁候感遐心。\n策蹇慙远途，巢枝思故林。\n小人恐致寇，终日如临深。\n鱼鸟好自逸，池笼安所钦。\n挂冠东都门，采蕨南山岑。\n议道诚愧昔，览分还惬今。\n怃然忧成老，空尔白头吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03016.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03016","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}